{sov: Notes}
Structure: Folk-rock inspired structure driving a strong pentatonic melodic 
line in A minor.

Rhythm: Steady 4/4 driving rhythm. Keep acoustic strumming or picking crisp 
to complement the atmospheric synth and traditional melodic hooks.

Harmonic Flow: The chorus relies on a classic step-wise pop progression 
(F - G - C - Am), with E7 serving as the secondary dominant pulling back to Am 
or F.
{eov}